#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:20002
#: da67d174d14e498c9af505605ee78a70
msgid "Noise Budgeting and Multi-Channel Correlation Analysis"
msgstr "ノイズバジェッティングと多チャンネル相関解析"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:20004
#: 6ac5b599523a4b6ab215853d4338c3b9
msgid ""
"In precision measurements (such as gravitational wave detectors), "
"identifying the origin of noise contained in the main observation data is "
"extremely important. This process is called **Noise Budgeting**."
msgstr ""
"精密計測（重力波検出器など）において、メインの観測データに含まれる雑音が「何に由来するのか」を特定することは極めて重要です。このプロセスを "
"**Noise Budgeting（ノイズバジェッティング）** と呼びます。"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:20006
#: 267d7cbcf6ec474dae85b465dc448483
msgid ""
"The sensitivity curve of a gravitational wave detector is limited by ground "
"vibrations at low frequencies, thermal noise at mid frequencies, and "
"statistical noise (shot noise) at high frequencies, exhibiting a "
"characteristic \"U-shaped\" profile."
msgstr "重力波検出器の感度曲線は、低周波では地面振動、中周波では熱雑音、高周波では統計的なノイズ（ショットノイズ）によって制限され、特徴的な「下に凸」の形状を示します。"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:20008
#: 714ef1e9cb244720b958c0c08a57b367
msgid "In this tutorial, we will demonstrate the analysis with the following flow:"
msgstr "このチュートリアルでは、以下の流れで解析を実演します。"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:20010
#: a610c9a0c10a41d8b947ecb7a179b210
msgid ""
"**Multi-Channel Data Simulation**: In addition to the main channel, we "
"generate auxiliary channels for ground vibrations, magnetic field "
"fluctuations, circuit noise, etc."
msgstr "**多チャンネルデータのシミュレーション**: メインチャンネルに加え、地面振動、磁場変動、回路ノイズなどの補助チャンネルを生成します。"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:20011
#: 47cec81e859547538b83bcab0520efe8
msgid ""
"**Coherence Mapping**: Calculate the coherence between the main channel and "
"each auxiliary channel to identify the primary noise sources."
msgstr "**相関解析 (Coherence Mapping)**: メインチャンネルと各補助チャンネルのコヒーレンスを計算し、主なノイズ源を特定します。"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:20012
#: ed31fcf09ef849a5825abf60393bf9bb
msgid ""
"**Transfer Function Estimation**: Estimate the \"coupling strength (transfer"
" function)\" from the auxiliary channels to the main channel."
msgstr "**結合関数の推定 (Transfer Function)**: 補助チャンネルからメインへの「漏れ込み量（伝達関数）」を推定します。"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:20013
#: 9c70c45933d3477ebed9a48a994c1f1b
msgid ""
"**Noise Projection**: Using the transfer function, convert (project) the "
"noise from the auxiliary channels into the units of the main channel."
msgstr "**ノイズ投影 (Noise Projection)**: 伝達関数を用いて、補助チャンネルのノイズをメインチャンネルの単位に変換（投影）します。"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:20014
#: cd2426d0b62547d1b565de8e7954c29b
msgid ""
"**Noise Budget Visualization (Noise Budget Plot)**: Overlay all noise "
"sources to reveal the breakdown of the observed \"U-shaped\" spectrum."
msgstr "**ノイズ予算の可視化 (Noise Budget Plot)**: すべてのノイズ源を重ね合わせ、観測された「U字型」スペクトルの内訳を明らかにします。"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:40002
#: 436f0e131f5d44449173b2a44beff790
msgid "1. Multi-Channel Data Simulation (Creating a U-Shaped Spectrum)"
msgstr "1\\. 多チャンネルデータのシミュレーション (U字型スペクトルの作成)"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:40004
#: 063bb5a05bc641b8b5aefaf04c979c3f
msgid "We create a sensitivity curve that mimics a gravitational wave detector."
msgstr "重力波検出器を模した感度曲線を作成します。"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:40005
#: a69e274082bd4b038aaaf476f7ba7d77
msgid ""
"`MAIN`: The observation target. Has a \"U-shaped\" spectrum dominated by "
"ground vibrations in the low-frequency region and actuator/circuit system "
"noise in the high-frequency region."
msgstr "`MAIN`: 観測対象。低域で地面振動、高域でアクチュエータ/回路系のノイズが支配的な「下に凸」のスペクトルを持ちます。"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:40006
#: cd4a901d40474192886c780fdb2ca88c
msgid "`AUX_SEIS`: Monitors low-frequency ground vibrations."
msgstr "`AUX_SEIS`: 低周波の地面振動をモニター。"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:40007
#: 163130fc9ab84a8baf5d5bf6682a17b9
msgid "`AUX_MAG`: Magnetic field monitor (including 60Hz power line)."
msgstr "`AUX_MAG`: 磁場モニター（60Hzの電源ラインを含む）。"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:40008
#: 868e65fef23b424da54d23058b7b19a6
msgid ""
"`AUX_ELEC`: High-frequency noise source (e.g., control system or readout "
"circuit noise)."
msgstr "`AUX_ELEC`: 高周波側のノイズ源（例：制御システムや読み出し回路のノイズ）。"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:60002
#: 079f1e72578240ec93ede3d11c4066ae
msgid "2. Coherence Mapping"
msgstr "2\\. 相関解析 (Coherence Mapping)"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:60004
#: c428118159c844789a8f7d00ba3a205f
msgid ""
"We check which sensors have high coherence with the left side, bottom, and "
"right side of the \"U-shape\" of the main channel."
msgstr "メインチャンネルの「U字」の左側、底、右側で、それぞれどのセンサーと高いコヒーレンスを持っているかを確認します。"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:80002
#: b9f092f48b1e4d26923aa4f1f0f9e996
msgid "3. Transfer Function Estimation"
msgstr "3\\. 結合関数の推定"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:80004
#: d786e7aa51974957aa21a75dce9d4f11
msgid ""
"We estimate the coupling coefficients (transfer functions) in each frequency"
" band."
msgstr "各帯域における漏れ込み係数（伝達関数）を推定します。"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:80006
#: cf227db0530f4303a477f80267e50e33
msgid ""
"`witness.transfer_function(MAIN)` estimates the numerical output/input ratio"
" using the native channel values. Its GWpy-compatible result is "
"dimensionless. We explicitly attach `MAIN.unit / witness.unit` before "
"multiplying by the witness ASD; every projected contribution then has MAIN "
"amplitude per square root hertz. The estimation and ASD use the same segment"
" length, overlap, and Hann window."
msgstr ""
"`witness.transfer_function(MAIN)` は、各チャンネルの値を使って出力と入力の数値的な比を推定します。GWpy "
"と互換の結果は無次元です。補助チャンネルの ASD を掛ける前に `MAIN.unit / witness.unit` "
"を明示的に付与することで、推定した各寄与の単位が MAIN の振幅単位/√Hz になります。伝達関数の推定と ASD "
"には、同じ区間長、オーバーラップ、Hann 窓を使います。"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:80008
#: bfa4795edaee42dca03ac9abf9c7c709
msgid ""
"Quadrature addition assumes independent noise sources. Shared witness noise "
"can be counted more than once, and a finite-data estimate need not lie below"
" the observed ASD in every frequency bin. Use the [Wiener filtering case "
"study](case_wiener_filter.ipynb) for correlated witnesses."
msgstr ""
"二乗和平方根による合成は、ノイズ源の独立性を仮定します。補助チャンネル間で共通するノイズは重複して数えられる場合があります。また、有限長のデータからの推定値が、すべての周波数ビンで観測"
" ASD を下回るとは限りません。相関のある補助チャンネルを扱う場合は、[Wiener "
"フィルタのケーススタディ](case_wiener_filter.ipynb)を参照してください。"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:100002
#: 98216f1e4a0348c3913f1160d3c33b75
msgid "4. Noise Projection"
msgstr "4\\. ノイズ投影 (Noise Projection)"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:120002
#: 7056f7cebfdf4644b4d6c56e44cbd727
msgid "5. Noise Budget Visualization (Noise Budget Plot)"
msgstr "5\\. ノイズ予算の可視化 (Noise Budget Plot)"

#: ../docs_redesign/how-to/case-studies/case_noise_budget.ipynb:120004
#: 4216069e225244edb084711a91ea796a
msgid ""
"We display how the \"U-shaped\" noise of the main channel is explained and "
"decomposed."
msgstr "「下に凸」のメインチャンネルのノイズが、どのように解説・分解されるかを表示します。"
